      "body": "I don't have any `android.permission.MY_READ_INSTALLED_PACKAGES` in my android manifest file.\r\nJust check it:\r\n- version 6: https://github.com/pichillilorenzo/flutter_inappwebview/blob/master/android/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml\r\n- version 5: https://github.com/pichillilorenzo/flutter_inappwebview/blob/v5.7.2%2B2/android/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml\r\n\r\nI don't see why the delay initialization should fix it. My plugin doesn't use it.\r\n\r\nMaybe, is it related to https://github.com/pichillilorenzo/flutter_inappwebview/issues/1371 ?",
